6.3.2.2 Bundle / single-resource shape rules
6.3.2.3 Mixed-version-Bundle prohibition
6.3.3 Generic / extension artifacts
6.3.4 (EX) one of each
6.4 Status reporting
6.4.1 `requestStatus[]` SHALL cover every request item exactly once
6.4.2 Status code registry — `fulfilled` / `partial` / `unavailable` / `declined` / `unsupported` / `error`
6.4.3 Optional `message`
6.5 Many-to-many fulfillment
6.5.1 One artifact may fulfill many items
6.5.2 One item may be fulfilled by many artifacts
6.5.3 (EX) shared QuestionnaireResponse
